  "details": "I strongly believe VRChat should consider integrating an official in-game live streaming and creator monetization system, similar to Twitch.\n\nHow it would work:\n\nA user could host a live performance within a designated world (e.g., a music venue or stage world). This could involve singing, dancing, or even just engaging in entertaining talk shows.\n\nViewers would be able to directly support the creators using an in-game currency/payment system (like \"Cheer\" items or \"Gifts\").\n\nWhy this benefits everyone:\n\nVRChat: You gain a significant new revenue stream through the in-game payment system.\n\nCreators/Performers: It provides a new way for talented community members to earn money directly for their performances and efforts.\n\nUsers: It drastically increases engaging content and gives users more reasons to log in and attend live events.\n\nThis feature would transform VRChat into a premier virtual entertainment hub.",
